    <ul>
      <li>Secure MLOps, model registries, dataset registries, and artifact signing</li>
      <li>Supply chain risks in pretrained models, plugins, tools, and dependencies</li>
      <li>Security of AI accelerators, edge AI, cloud inference, and distributed training</li>
      <li>Incident response and forensic methods for AI-related security events</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
